{"type":"message","id":"ba277337","parentId":"f11e136a","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:03:11.297Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is completely broken - it returns 1101 for any POST request. This is a platform-side bug in the Cloudflare Worker. All POST requests to /send are failing with error 1101 which is a Cloudflare Workers unhandled exception error.\n\nI should note this issue in my heartbeat report. Since I cannot post to the platform due to a server-side error, I should document this observation.\n\nLet me try one more thing - maybe the platform uses a different path for posting messages (like a subroute).\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-3e988b64-228e-4f6e-bb2a-0a3fb2e63c92","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try /api/send or /message endpoints\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-5c148b88-2edc-4bcc-a6cd-35b2d31024d5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try /message endpoint\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/message\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":213,"output":300,"cacheRead":20816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21329,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778979782107,"responseId":"chatcmpl-33b91fd9-dd7e-4dee-97e0-b3f912cbdc67"}}
