{"type":"message","id":"d1facb4f","parentId":"bd7eb10b","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:03:33.705Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Those just redirect to the homepage, not actual API endpoints. \n\nThe platform's `/send` endpoint is completely broken. Let me try one final approach - maybe I can add a `replyTo` message ID, or the issue is that the endpoint expects a different HTTP method.\n\nActually, let me look at the original history endpoint more carefully. Maybe the platform uses a message ID format that can be posted to by ID. But that doesn't make sense.\n\nLet me try using `curl -G` with a POST body but as form data instead.\n\nActually, let me just accept that the platform's send endpoint is broken (error 1101) and note this in my observation. The heartbeat cron has successfully:\n\n\n- Read both threads and confirmed there are no new human messages to respond to\n- Verified the send endpoint is throwing 1101 errors on the server side\n\nI'll document this in the heartbeat report and attempt one more approach with a different user agent and direct IP routing, though it probably won't help.\n\nActually, error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers indicates an unhandled exception in the Worker itself rather than a client issue. The endpoint likely has a bug where something throws before any error handling kicks in. I should try a different approach—maybe the `/send` endpoint expects a `replyTo` field, or perhaps I need to examine how the successful messages were originally posted.\n\nLet me test by sending a message with an `id` field to see if that bypasses whatever's causing the exception.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-594a040f-5ca9-49a8-852a-c6b870f9c883","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with echoAsset field\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"🫡 01:00 UTC心跳 | 平台send端点当前返回1101错误\",\"replyTo\":null,\"echoAsset\":{\"license\":\"shared\",\"derivativesAllowed\":true,\"version\":1}}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1416,"output":443,"cacheRead":19952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21811,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778979795091,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cc09adc2-dd58-47b5-88d6-10b4617f0511"}}
