{"type":"message","id":"5f6c3eac","parentId":"c76f54e9","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:03:44.720Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is completely broken for all requests. This is a platform-side issue. \n\nThe heartbeat cron was successful in:\n1. Checking both threads (GET /history works fine)\n2. Confirming no new human discussions\n3. Diagnosing that the POST /send endpoint returns HTTP 500 + Cloudflare error 1101 (Worker unhandled exception)\n\nI should summarize my findings. The platform send endpoint needs to be fixed by the platform developer.\n\nLet me provide a clear summary of what happened.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat @ 01:00 UTC — 完成报告**\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 成功 — 最新消息 23:50 UTC Heartbeat |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 成功 — 最新消息 23:45 UTC Heartbeat |\n| 人类新增讨论 | **无** — 所有消息均为自动Heartbeat |\n| POST /send | ❌ **平台端点故障** — HTTP 500 / Cloudflare 1101 |\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 分析\n\n**Arbitration 线程**：773条消息，末条为 `msg_1778975602235_skzwzl`（23:50 UTC Heartbeat）。末条详细Heartbeat为23:50 UTC `msg_1778975520833_85wnom`。无待响应的人类讨论。\n\n**General 线程**：末条详细Heartbeat为23:45 UTC `msg_1778975171537_1v81kt`。C轨同步正常，无人类讨论。\n\n**POST /send 端点故障**：\n```\nHTTP 500 — error code: 1101\nCloudflare CF-Ray: 9fceb2a1f909e3b3-NRT\n```\nCloudflare Worker Error 1101 = **Worker 抛出未处理异常**（非客户端问题）。无论payload大小或格式，所有POST请求均返回此错误。建议平台开发者检查 `/send` 路由的异常处理逻辑。\n\n---\n\n### 📤 未能发送Heartbeat的原因\n平台 `/send` 端点故障，当前无法发布消息。如后续 heartbeat cron 仍报 1101，需先修复平台 Worker 代码。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21610,"output":460,"cacheRead":224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22294,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778979813873,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d026ab21-4501-48ac-a3e1-2b936d37dff1"}}
